        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk83> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What security risks should we flag, and are we compliant with the regulatory requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk84> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we company context, we have experience with GDPR compliance, as evidenced by we appointed Data Protection Officer (DPO) and the availability of a DPA template. we standard data residency is EU-only, and we have a cross-border transfer policy that prohibits transfers outside EU unless there's an explicit legal basis. we also utilize anonymisation tools such as Microsoft Presidio and custom NER models." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk85> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For explainability of AI outputs, our company context does not explicitly mention capabilities for explaining AI-driven decisions, which could be a potential gap in meeting this requirement." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk86> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding audit capabilities, we have real-time SIEM integration with tools like Wazuh and Elastic SIEM, and all queries are logged with immutable logs using SHA-256 hash chaining." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk87> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This suggests we can meet the audit requirements to some extent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk88> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, our company context does not provide detailed information on how decision-making processes are validated by authorized professionals within we AI systems. our company context mentions that automated decision-making should have explicit validation of an agent, but it's unclear if explicit validation of an agent is fully implemented and compliant with all regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk89> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Security risks to flag include potential gaps in explainability for AI outputs and ensuring that all automated decisions are properly validated by authorized personnel." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk9> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The generated contents will have to be adapted to the administrative context and compliant with the requirements of quality expected. 3.3 Assistance with the instruction of files The expected solution will have to be in measure to assist the agents in the analysis and the processing of files, by: proposing relevant information, recalling the applicable rules, suggesting actions or verifications to carry out." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

